&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fI_oUfNYdwY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Rope-braiding competition&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sHHru1St3xw&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Spinning competition&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B_ySB3TBR5s&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Potato peeling&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I2-UXNCox1Y&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Inca maidens dancing&lt;/a&gt;
